      "locked": false,
      "text": "On reaching our\nwebsite the doc\nshould first have \nto upload a report\nand then what i \nthink according to \nthe features we \nhave extracted we\ncan tell doc which\ndiseases can we identify \nmost precisely we can do this through applying system1\nmodel like jev.\nAnd can also include feature which will \nshow to identify this kind of disease what features\nare still lacking and what is required.",
